<v Michael>Air balls, like the ball kept falling out of my hands. It was just bad. That was the worst I've ever done in my life in basketball.
<v Michael>三不沾，就像球一直从我手中掉下来。太糟糕了。那是我一生中在篮球方面做过的最糟糕表现。

