<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Michael didn't even make the first cut.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>迈克尔甚至没有通过第一轮筛选。

00:42:32.160 --> 00:42:53.050
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Michael has a lot of metaphors to describe the next period of his life. He told me it was like the school was wearing a mask. And after tryouts, the mask came off. In this metaphor, Michael concedes he put the mask on the school. The NBA fantasy, that's the mask. But he says after tryouts, the school was naked and it looked ugly.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>迈克尔有很多比喻来描述他生命中的下一个时期。他告诉我，这就像学校戴着面具。而试训后，面具摘下来了。在这个比喻里，迈克尔承认是他把面具戴在了学校身上。NBA幻想，那是面具。但他说试训后，学校赤裸裸的，看起来很丑。

00:42:53.050 --> 00:43:06.370
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Suddenly he could see everything clearly. He wasn't a mile away from the NBA. He was lonely, far from home in a huge school he didn't like, in a neighborhood he didn't like, in a life he didn't like.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>突然间他看清了一切。他离NBA不是一英里远。他很孤独，远离家乡，在一所他不喜欢的大学校里，在一个他不喜欢的地方，在一个他不喜欢的生活里。

00:43:06.370 --> 00:43:18.500
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>He started coming to school late, really late, three hours late. He failed his first period class. And when Michael did show up, he'd just spend all his time thinking about his old school, about Union.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>他开始迟到，真的很晚，迟到三个小时。他挂了第一节课。当迈克尔确实出现时，他只会花所有时间去想他的旧学校，“联合”学校。

00:43:18.500 --> 00:43:40.110
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>At lunch, he'd sit there wondering what they were eating back at Union, which field trips they were going on this year. And then at night, he'd go and check Facebook and try to figure out what happened that day at Union. Michael told his principal he wanted to go back to Union. The principal said there's no way to transfer mid-year. He'd have to wait until the summer, and then see if his old school had a spot for him.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>午餐时，他会坐在那儿想他们在“联合”学校吃什么，今年他们要去哪些实地考察。然后在晚上，他会去查Facebook，试图弄清楚“联合”学校那天发生了什么。迈克尔告诉他的校长他想回到“联合”学校。校长说学期中不可能转学。他得等到夏天，看看他的旧学校有没有名额。

00:43:40.110 --> 00:43:51.070
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>So Michael did what any 15-year-old does when he doesn't like the answer he's given. He asked again and again. And when he got the same answer, he started asking other people.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>所以迈克尔做了任何一个15岁孩子在不喜欢得到的答案时会做的事情。他一遍又一遍地问。当他得到同样的答案时，他开始问其他人。

00:43:51.070 --> 00:44:02.520
<v Michael>I kept asking teachers, how could I transfer out? They said, the only way for you transfer out, you got to get a safety transfer. And that's by something that you feel is, like, dangerous around you that you can't be an area.
<v Michael>我一直问老师，我怎么才能转学？他们说，你转学的唯一方法是申请安全转学。那是因为你觉得你所在区域有什么让你感到危险的东西。

00:44:02.520 --> 00:44:19.990
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Safety transfer. That phrase stuck in Michael's brain, mostly because it included the word transfer. So Michael went back to the principal. What about a safety transfer? Can I get one of those? But Michael says the principal laughed. Safety transfers are for people whose safety has been threatened.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>“安全转学”。这个词组在迈克尔脑海中挥之不去，主要是因为它包含了“转学”这个词。所以迈克尔回去找校长。关于安全转学呢？我可以申请那种吗？但迈克尔说校长笑了。安全转学是针对那些人身安全受到威胁的人。

00:44:19.990 --> 00:44:25.880
<v Michael>He said, so far you're in good hands, so nothing has happened to you. Like, that I'm safe.
<v Michael>他说，到目前为止你还好好的，什么都没发生。就像，我是安全的。

00:44:25.880 --> 00:44:39.080
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>That's when it clicked for Michael. The only way to get back to his old school was to make himself less safe. So Michael hatched his plan. There were several steps. It begin with a simple purchase.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>就在那时，迈克尔灵光一现。回到旧学校的唯一方法是让自己变得不安全。所以迈克尔策划了他的计划。有几个步骤。开始于简单的购买。

00:44:39.080 --> 00:44:44.190
<v Michael>OK. I went to a Chinese website, and I bought the hat.
<v Michael>好的。我上了一个中文网站，买了一顶帽子。

00:44:44.190 --> 00:44:48.990
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Michael bought a winter hat, an NBA one, a beanie with a fuzzball at the top.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>迈克尔买了一顶冬帽，NBA的那种，顶端有个绒球的毛线帽。

