<v Michael>It was a NBA team beanie, my favorite NBA team, Knicks. Ordered it. Week later, got it. Wore it to school. Get off the train, and I'm making eye contact. I'm trying to make as much eye contact as I can with, like, all the people that kind of looks scary, that had, like, sag in their pants, had chains on.
<v Michael>那是一顶NBA球队的毛线帽，我最喜欢的NBA球队，尼克斯队。订了。一周后，收到了。戴着它去学校。下火车，我正在寻求目光接触。我试着尽可能多地与那些看起来有点可怕、裤子下垂、戴着链子的人进行目光接触。

00:45:08.570 --> 00:45:20.220
<v Michael>So I was looking at people. Seeing some kid in the store, right? I just like glared my eyes at him. But, like, I didn't make just eye contact. I stared at them. I counted to three. I said, one, two, three.
<v Michael>所以我盯着人看。在店里看到某个孩子，对吧？我只是用眼睛瞪着他。但是，我不仅仅是目光接触。我盯着他们。我数到三。我说，一，二，三。

00:45:20.220 --> 00:45:36.860
<v Michael>Heard, "Yo, boy. Come here." He ran up behind me, tapped me in the chest. I said, "Yeah, what do you want from me?" In the same exact tone. "Yeah, what do you want from me?" He was like, "Yo, you got any money on you? You got your phone on you?"
<v Michael>听到，“嘿，小伙子。过来。”他跑到我身后，拍了拍我的胸口。我说，“是的，你想要我干什么？”用同样的语气。“是的，你想要我干什么？”他说，“嘿，你身上有钱吗？你有手机吗？”

00:45:36.860 --> 00:45:51.070
<v Michael>I was like, "No, I don't. Want my hat, though?" He was like, "Actually, yeah. Give me your hat." I gave it to him. He said, "Yo, if you lying to me, if you have your phone or wallet, don't lie to me. You better give it to me, or my squad's gonna jump you."
<v Michael>我说，“没有。不过想要我的帽子吗？”他说，“其实，好吧。把帽子给我。”我给了他。他说，“嘿，如果你对我撒谎，如果你有手机或钱包，别对我撒谎。你最好给我，否则我的兄弟们会揍你。”

00:45:51.070 --> 00:46:01.710
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Michael did have a wallet in his pocket and an iPod in his sock. So he ran, ran across the street fast-- almost got hit by a truck-- and right into the school.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>迈克尔口袋里确实有一个钱包，袜子里有一个iPod。所以他跑了，飞快地跑过马路——差点被卡车撞到——直接跑进学校。

00:46:01.710 --> 00:46:12.620
<v Michael>No, it wasn't like, oh, I just got robbed. I need help. It was, yo! I just got robbed! Son, I just got robbed. I got to tell all the teachers. I'm about to get this transfer!
<v Michael>不，那不是像，噢，我刚被抢了。我需要帮助。而是，嘿！我刚被抢了！哥们，我刚被抢了。我得告诉所有的老师。我马上就能拿到转学名额了！

00:46:12.620 --> 00:46:21.330
<v Michael>And then all my friends came up to me, like, yo, I heard you got robbed. I was like, yeah, I got robbed! Kids starting telling teachers. Teachers even came up to me, asking, are you OK?
<v Michael>然后我所有的朋友都过来找我，比如，嘿，我听说你被抢了。我说，是啊，我被抢了！孩子们开始告诉老师。老师甚至过来问我，你还好吗？

00:46:21.330 --> 00:46:30.760
<v Michael>Went to the principal, told the principal what happened. Went to the precinct, filed a police report. Then I went back to the assistant principal and got my file.
<v Michael>我去找了校长，告诉校长发生了什么。去了警察局，报了警。然后我又回到副校长那里拿到了我的档案。

