<v Michael>That was the only way I could get a safety transfer.
<v Michael>那是拿到安全转学的唯一方法。

00:47:19.530 --> 00:47:22.650
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>But you could have-- but nobody knew that they took your hat, right?
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>但你可以——但没人知道他们拿走了你的帽子，对吧？

