<v Michael>No.
<v Michael>不。

00:47:23.620 --> 00:47:26.050
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>You could have just put the beanie under your bed at home--
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>你本可以把毛线帽放在家里床下——

