<v Michael>Yeah, that's true.
<v Michael>是的，那是真的。

00:47:26.450 --> 00:47:27.160
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>--and said that you got robbed.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>——然后说你被抢了。

00:47:27.160 --> 00:47:44.860
<v Michael>That's true too. I don't know why I did it. I don't know. I just felt like I needed the experience. So, like, instead of me just saying, oh, I got robbed. They took my hat. I said, no! I got robbed! They actually took my hat and left, and they ran away with it!
<v Michael>那也是真的。我不知道为什么我非要那样做。我不知道。我只是觉得我需要那种体验。所以，而不是我说，噢，我被抢了。他们拿走了我的帽子。我说，不！我被抢了！他们确实拿走了我的帽子，然后跑掉了，还带着它！

