00:49:15.980 --> 00:49:26.950
<v Michael>And I remember teachers-- I remember walking into the teachers' lounge. And everybody was screaming, It was like, oh! And that was when I knew that that was my welcome back to my old school.
<v Michael>我还记得老师——我记得走进教师休息室。每个人都在尖叫，就像，噢！那时我就知道，这就是我回到旧学校的欢迎仪式。

